{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A DOG, AN ISLAND, AN UNFORGETTABLE ADVENTURE... AND A LOT OF PIZZA!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After an unexpected shipwreck, Toni, a pizza-obsessed sailor dog, finds himself stranded on the mysterious Salamino Island \u2013 a place inhabited by dogs, where cats have been banned for generations. To get back home, he must explore every corner of the island, uncover ancient secrets, and face an erupting volcano.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Can Toni transform the island, currently in chaos, into a peaceful paradise?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908830/extras/city.gif?t=1741217744\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A LIVING ISLAND TO EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Salamino Island features <strong>five unique towns</strong>, each with its own distinct characteristics, architecture, and inhabitants. From coastal villages to a <strong>vibrant metropolis</strong>, each area holds its own culture, challenges, and secrets waiting to be discovered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908830/extras/dung.gif?t=1741217744\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SMART PUZZLE CHALLENGES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The island's dungeons are filled with creative puzzles and boss battles that will keep you on your toes. Don't worry \u2013 these challenges are fun and engaging without taking up hours of your time! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908830/extras/museum.gif?t=1741217744\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ADVENTURE BEYOND THE MAIN STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition to the main quest, Toni can assist the local museum in completing its collections or decorate his beach cabin with found items. There\u2019s always something new to explore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908830/extras/surf.gif?t=1741217744\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MINIGAMES TO UNWIND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take a break from the adventure with fun activities! Grab your surfboard for a relaxing minigame or take on a pizza delivery challenge to satisfy the islanders\u2019 hunger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908830/extras/enemy.gif?t=1741217744\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CASUAL COMBAT AND RELAXING GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While combat isn\u2019t the main focus, Toni can battle enemies in a laid-back way to earn some extra cash and take a mental break between the puzzle challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAME FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>A true 8-bit experience</strong> reminiscent of classic handheld games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f <strong>Five towns</strong>, each with its own charm and secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc7e Memorable characters with captivating stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcdc An engaging narrative with hidden secrets to uncover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9 Dungeons focused on puzzles and exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae Fun side quests and items to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0a Minigames like surfing and pizza delivery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf55 <strong>Plenty of pizza</strong> for Toni to enjoy along the way!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2908830?t=1741217744","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2908830?t=1741217744","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908830/f580e57556033d699bdfc24a52114f2680b077e4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741217744","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908830/f580e57556033d699bdfc24a52114f2680b077e4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741217744","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3144730,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A DOG, AN ISLAND, AN UNFORGETTABLE ADVENTURE... AND A LOT OF PIZZA!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After an unexpected shipwreck, Toni, a pizza-obsessed sailor dog, finds himself stranded on the mysterious Salamino Island \u2013 a place inhabited by dogs, where cats have been banned for generations. To get back home, he must explore every corner of the island, uncover ancient secrets, and face an erupting volcano.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Can Toni transform the island, currently in chaos, into a peaceful paradise?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908830/extras/city.gif?t=1741217744\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A LIVING ISLAND TO EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Salamino Island features <strong>five unique towns</strong>, each with its own distinct characteristics, architecture, and inhabitants. From coastal villages to a <strong>vibrant metropolis</strong>, each area holds its own culture, challenges, and secrets waiting to be discovered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908830/extras/dung.gif?t=1741217744\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SMART PUZZLE CHALLENGES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The island's dungeons are filled with creative puzzles and boss battles that will keep you on your toes. Don't worry \u2013 these challenges are fun and engaging without taking up hours of your time! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908830/extras/museum.gif?t=1741217744\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ADVENTURE BEYOND THE MAIN STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition to the main quest, Toni can assist the local museum in completing its collections or decorate his beach cabin with found items. There\u2019s always something new to explore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908830/extras/surf.gif?t=1741217744\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MINIGAMES TO UNWIND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take a break from the adventure with fun activities! Grab your surfboard for a relaxing minigame or take on a pizza delivery challenge to satisfy the islanders\u2019 hunger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908830/extras/enemy.gif?t=1741217744\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CASUAL COMBAT AND RELAXING GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While combat isn\u2019t the main focus, Toni can battle enemies in a laid-back way to earn some extra cash and take a mental break between the puzzle challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAME FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>A true 8-bit experience</strong> reminiscent of classic handheld games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f <strong>Five towns</strong>, each with its own charm and secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc7e Memorable characters with captivating stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcdc An engaging narrative with hidden secrets to uncover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9 Dungeons focused on puzzles and exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae Fun side quests and items to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0a Minigames like surfing and pizza delivery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf55 <strong>Plenty of pizza</strong> for Toni to enjoy along the way!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Frolic Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908830/ea65ec81e2eb44d384d34f607a7f4672909e5612/header.jpg?t=1741217744","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 (or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Made with GB Studio</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04 / Debian 12 / Fedora 38+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB avai